---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /changelog/
pageKey: changelog
title: Changelog — OtakuPlay
description: Every change to the OtakuPlay catalogue, pulled straight from git history at build time — not a hand-maintained list that can drift from what actually shipped.
---

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-tag">📜 History</div>
    <h1 class="section-title">Changelog</h1>
    <p class="section-desc">
      Every commit that touched the catalogue, newest first — generated from git
      history at build time, so it can't drift from what actually shipped.
      <a href="{{ root }}feed.xml">RSS feed</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class="changelog-list">
    {% for entry in changelog %}
      <li class="changelog-item" id="{{ entry.hash }}">
        <span class="changelog-date">{{ entry.date }}</span>
        <span class="changelog-subject">{{ entry.subject }}</span>
        <a class="changelog-hash" href="{{ site.repo }}/commit/{{ entry.hash }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ entry.hash }}</a>
      </li>
    {% else %}
      <p class="stat-empty">No history available in this build.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
